      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mose nee bariisér Israeli tawa dinkwárí dirii'i, múk Israeli sleémeero guna báy, «Hara'ayaarí laarí ni kuungií hara'ayiyiim oohaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bál yaaér Yordani bara waarahhé', nee tari daté' baraá yaamaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ni haniisi, tlaa/aá uren ki sihhá' nee ki daandeemo ninkiritsá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá dandeemaá tlaa/eedae /aymi'i sleémeero awa dabeerí ki gooiindá' qoomár bara daté' baraá yaamuudá' diihhooár ilwa nee dane, kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'iihúng naa al'axweés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár bar yaaér Yordaniro aga waarahhé', tlaa/eeká' sihhaak gawaá tloomár Ebali, ar adoorí laarí ngira dirhúngií hara'ayiím, nee ki ninkiritsá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng amoodae kitángw ilahhooa ti tlehhe' ar tlaa/e awa taa dakwiiká ar muqsla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' kitángw ilahhooár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kudá' ta tlehha' masók aqo un tlehhá' ar tlaa/aá taa dakwiiká. Daqaní gawaá kitaangwihe AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ilahhooár da/a ti hanmise'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i ti hanise', nee ka didá' wa /agá', nee ta qwalala/á' dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá daanduú tlaa/eedá' taa ninkiritsi axweesanayduú dabe sleémeero gooiro geehhooeesa hhe'eesaak.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
