          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaadae Mose muu guri adoorí báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' yaaér Yordani bar aga waarahhé', tlahhi'iiká' i sihhiitiye' gawaá tloomár Gerisimu, as muu nguwa tsuuqiya': Tlahhoó Simeon, nee oo Laáwi, nee oo Yuda, nee oo Isakari, nee oo Yosefu nee oo Benyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee tlahhi'iiká' i sihhiitiye' gawaá tloomár Ebali qoomár lo'ooro: Tlahhoó Reubeni, nee oo Gadi, nee oo Asheri nee oo Sebuluni nee oo Dani nee oo Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Laáwi kaangwí ngu ilahaniisiye' dír múk Israeli sleémeero ar afór ur, ta ooi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Umuúqo heewo oo slaqsaay gwaa tleehh, laqaá gwaa kwahhuut, nee umuúqo gaaro ar taa tleéhh ar daba' kari qawti sihhtís, tidá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i waki, kwaa lu'ús.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
